# Gatekeeper Playbook

## Opening

"Hi, this is [YOUR NAME] with Frost & Sullivan."

"I'm part of the research team supporting [ANALYST NAME], who's leading research in the [INDUSTRY] space."

"Based on that work, [COMPANY] has been nominated for evaluation through our Best Practices Recognition program."

"I'm trying to connect with the person who can speak most confidently about the company's strategy, innovation, customer value, growth, or market position."

"Who would you recommend I speak with?"

## Is the Executive Expecting Your Call?

"Not a scheduled call, no. This is our outreach related to the research [ANALYST NAME] has been conducting. We're trying to find a convenient time rather than catch them unexpectedly."

Never imply a meeting already exists.
